# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [1.1] - 2026-03-16

### Changed
- Separated normal and permutated domain processing into distinct sequential phases
- Modified workflow to run httpx on normal domains first, then proceed to permutation phase
- Updated file naming conventions:
  - `dnsx_all_resolved.txt` → `dnsx_resolved.txt` (normal domains)
  - `dnsx_permutated_resolved_output.txt` → `dnsx_permutated_resolved.txt` (permutated domains)
  - `httpx_dnsx_all_resolved_scan.txt` → `httpx_scan.txt` (normal domains)
  - Added `httpx_permutated_scan.txt` (permutated domains)
- Updated workflow functions:
  - `subdomainResolvePermute()` → `processingSubdomains()` and `permutateSubdomains()`
  - Removed `finalHttpxScan()` function (logic integrated into new functions)
- Modified `httpxExec()` to accept optional output filename parameter
- Modified `alterxExec()` to read from `dnsx_resolved.txt` instead of `dnsx_all_resolved.txt`
- Updated cleanup logic to preserve new output files and remove intermediate files
- Added descriptive comments to all workflow functions in `src/assets.py`


## [1.0] - 2026-02-25

### Added
- Optional second wordlist support (`-sw/--second-wordlist`)
- Argument validation with helpful error messages
- CHANGELOG to track version history

### Changed
- Simplified console output: replaced live status table with text-based status display
- Combined "Resolving" and "Permutation" phases into single "Resolving and Permutation" phase
- Made `-fw/--first-wordlist` optional (requires at least one wordlist)
- Made `-sw/--second-wordlist` fully optional
- Help menu now displays without printing the banner first
- Cleanup now runs silently (only prints on errors)
- Added newline separation between HTTPX results and cleanup phase

### Removed
- Dead code: `run_tool()` function in src/commands.py
- Dead code: `create_dot_progress()` function in src/output.py
- Dead code: `create_status_table()` function in src/output.py
- Unused imports: `threading`, `time` from src/assets.py
- Unused imports: `Panel`, `Prompt`, `Progress`, `TextColumn`, `BarColumn` from src/output.py

### Fixed
- Help menu now shows correctly when no arguments provided
- Duplicate import error in src/output.py
